  "$comment": "Legacy records without proposition_relation have unchecked proposition semantics; their historical relation is not semantic certification.",
  "description": "Relation between a revised claim and its predecessor (mlr3autoiml 0.1.6): one relation per scope element and a separate declaration of whether the revised claim follows."
